WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Choose the page from the sidebar
From the sidebar choose “Campaigns”.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Prepare the channel and template
Make sure WhatsApp is connected and that there is an approved template suited to the campaign.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:18.000
Create the campaign
Open Campaigns, add a campaign and choose the audience, the template and its variables according to the available options.

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Review before sending
Review the audience's consent, the content, the count and the cost or balance shown before you confirm sending, then follow the results.
